  "findings": [
    "Adapter overrides only _run, _native_input, _click and _check_hand_drag.",
    "_run adds native density/content scaling before invoking the unchanged parent run.",
    "Logical mouse position, global position and relative motion are mapped through final_transform; viewport input applies the inverse before GUI dispatch.",
    "Original gesture steps, scroll threshold, selection/event checks, target size/overlap and post-selection enclosure assertions are preserved.",
    "Corrected probe adds revision endpoint equality and renames passive endpoint assertion to describe its actual scope.",
    "Character coverage counts non-whitespace character bounds wholly enclosed within the actual ancestor clip; it records cumulative exposure across actual wheel events."
